Eggs are earned through server events and hatched manually.

== Egg Rules ==
* No egg buying
* Egg wins come from mini-games in Special Place
* Daily egg target: 6 wins server-wide
* If no winner: event expires and is rescheduled
* Same user cannot win egg events back-to-back

== Egg Event Window ==
* Active window: 2 minutes
* Failed event reschedule: 30 to 90 minutes

== Egg Mini-Games ==
* Speed Type (type exact phrase first)
* Reaction Lock (find correct button first)
* Emoji Memory (remember sequence and answer)
* Rapid Choice (A/B/C first correct)
* Quick Duel (two selected users duel by button)

== Hatching ==
Command:
* <code>/hatch egg_type:&lt;normal|mythic&gt;</code>

Hatch uses suspense roll output in chat.

